  "question": {
    "text": "For the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;if one of the roots is square of the other, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
